  "system": {
    "description": "<p><em>Countdown (Loop 1d6).</em> When the Spectral Terror is in the spotlight for the first time, activate the countdown. It ticks down when a PC rolls with Fear. When it triggers, the dragon roars with bone-chilling intensity. All targets in the scene must make a Presence Reaction Roll. On a failure, a target must mark <strong>1d4</strong> Stress and is <em>Vulnerable</em> until they roll with Hope. On a success, a target must mark a Stress. If the Spectral Terror is defeated while this countdown is active, trigger the countdown immediately as their final death wail.</p>",
